&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Performance&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Strong for many application types&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Strong for many application types&lt;/td&gt;
