&lt;td&gt;Hiring&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Benefits from broad JS/React ecosystem&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Requires Flutter/Dart talent&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
